# X6-08 / X6-09(T1) / W04 / O01 / O02 / O10 / T1 debug-contract / I03 / I04
#
# The receiver completes one terminal COMMIT, but both verified COMMIT ACKs are
# hidden from the source.  The normal sender then performs its authenticated
# QUERY_EPOCH_STATUS recovery.  A matching process-local COMMITTED result is
# evidence about the live receiver process only: it is not authoritative HA
# ownership proof and must not advance the source to COMMITTED_HANDOFF.
#
# Expected contract: DRAIN returns uncertain, the source publishes
# COMMIT_UNKNOWN and remains fenced, RESET is too late, the original waiter is
# still blocked, and the receiver retains exactly one READY/prepared/cache
# publication without promotion or adoption.  Eventual ownership resolution is
# intentionally outside this T1 case and remains blocked on an authoritative HA
# provider/caller.

--let $terminal_cas_case= 4
--source suite/preserve_trx_transfer_stby/include/run_terminal_cas_w01.inc
